@startuml three-generations
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Inter
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #0f1b2d
  BorderColor #7dd3fc
  FontColor #e0f2fe
}

component "Automated proof\nTests + static analysis" as Proof
component "Continuous delivery\nMainline + feedback" as Delivery
component "AI-assisted implementation\nMore choices, faster" as AI
rectangle "Proven business behavior\nImplementation remains replaceable" as Outcome #172554

Proof --> Delivery : checks every change
Delivery --> AI : safe surface for production
AI --> Proof : generated work returns\nfor verification
Delivery --> Outcome
Proof --> Outcome
AI --> Outcome
@enduml
